        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ava DuVernay, Jennifer Lee, Storm Reid, Chris Buck\n- Films: A Wrinkle in Time (2018 film), Home on the Range (2004 film), Pocahontas (1995)\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- Roles: director, writer, actor, supervising animator\n\nFacts:\n- Pocahontas is a 1995 film, and Chris Buck worked on it as a supervising animator.\n- Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Chris Buck also worked as a supervising animator on Home on the Range.\n- A Wrinkle in Time is a 2018 American science-fiction fantasy adventure film directed by Ava DuVernay and written by Jennifer Lee.\n- Storm Reid is set to portray Meg Murry in A Wrinkle in Time.",
